      "content": "i dont even know how im supposed to look people in the eye anymore. everything i built is just... gone. it feels like i'm in a freefall and the ground is just getting closer and closer. the thought of actually hitting the bottom, of everyone seeing me like this, it’s more terrifying than the loss itself. just the shame of it all.",
